        "original_id": "3de68600-f75c-5c5b-8b81-0d953f7bd08c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex Wyse, Jessica Stroup\n- TV Series: Iron Fist, The Defenders, 90210, The Following, The Bold and the Beautiful\n- Stage Productions: Spring Awakening\n- Concepts: Marvel Cinematic Universe\n\nFacts:\n- Jessica Leigh Stroup was born on October 23, 1986, and she is an American actress.\n- In 2015, Alex Wyse played Georg Zirschnitz in the Deaf West Broadway revival of Spring Awakening.\n- Alex Wyse is best known for playing Kyle in Marvel's Iron Fist and Saul Feinberg in The Bold and the Beautiful.\n- Jessica Stroup is best known for playing Erin Silver on 90210, Max Hardy on The Following, and Joy Meachum in Iron Fist.\n- Iron Fist is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe and shares continuity with the franchise's films.\n- Iron Fist is the fourth in a series of shows that lead to The Defenders crossover miniseries.",
